{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>隨後，攜程方迅速發出公告，稱將以此次處罰為契機，深入反思、自我革新，堅決摒棄「內卷式」低效競爭，堅定不移走高質量發展之路。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0725/07a6b61bdb3ec10.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>就在剛剛，攜程方再次發佈公告，公示十九項整改措施。</p>\n<p>原文如下：</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0725/f7e9fe71acd617b.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0725/20382b3262b5129.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0725/07a6b61bdb3ec10.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>原文如下：</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0725/f7e9fe71acd617b.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-25T08:10:02.728696+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":99,"images":5,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none"}}